#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:158
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"A few years ago, this region was a profitable place for trading.Now it is "
"full of bandits and pirates.Caution is worth it."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:159
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"This isolated region was plunged into chaos at the beginning of the "
"uprising.Even in peacetime, he was inhabited by pirates, but now the center "
"for managing numerous pirate fleets is based there."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:160
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"If the reports are true, this territory has been under the control of the "
"pirates for a long time.Some merchants are still trying to trade with the "
"remaining settlements, but they risk very much."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:161
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"Several friendly federations of planets still exist in this sector, but they"
" constantly suffer from pirate raids.This is a dangerous sector, so be "
"careful."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:162
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You arrived in the space of pirates.After the rebels performed, this sector "
"was undergoing a cruel raid and is held in the hands of the pirates to this "
"day.Be vigilant."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:163
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"This sector is known for constant robberies and raids on flying ships.Your "
"team wants to believe that if you behave like a pirate, they will take you "
"for your own and will not interfere with the flight."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:164
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"Previously, this sector was at the intersection of important trade routes, "
"now the merchants prefer to bypass it due to a sharp increase in the number "
"of pirates ..."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:165
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[8]"
msgstr ""
"To the lighthouse at the entrance to the sector, the \"Fun Roger\" is "
"guessed, it is probably worth reminding these savages what the federation "
"is."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:166
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[9]"
msgstr ""
"This sector was restless before the civil war, but now it is simply teeming "
"with pirates of all stripes.It is worth preparing for the worst."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:167
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[10]"
msgstr ""
"This sector can be safely called the native home of pirates and "
"looters.Check the shields and guns in case the oncoming ships "
